---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
bodyClass: home
---
<section class="hero">
  <img class="hero-img" src="/img/photos/elder-mountain-gorge.jpg" alt="The Tennessee River Gorge seen from Elder Mountain at sunset, the river curving around a forested ridge" eleventy:widths="800,1600,2400" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 1600px, 100vw" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
  <div class="hero-words">
    <h1><span class="h1-main">Elder Mountain</span> <span class="h1-sub">Volunteer Fire Department</span></h1>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="intro">
  <p class="tagline">Volunteering to save lives and property on Elder Mountain, Tennessee.</p>
  <div class="intro-side">
    <p>We are a 501(c)(3) nonprofit fire department staffed entirely by volunteers from the community, with mutual aid to our neighboring departments.</p>
    <p class="actions"><a class="button" href="/contact/?topic=join">Volunteer with us</a> <a class="text-link" href="/about/">About the department</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="response">
  <figure class="response-photo">
    <img src="/img/photos/engine-1-pump-panel.jpg" alt="Side of the engine showing the Elder Mountain Fire Rescue shield and the pump panel" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 55vw, 100vw">
  </figure>
  <div class="response-text">
    <h2>Rapid, all‑hazard response</h2>
    <p>We respond to the residents of Elder Mountain, and we back up our neighboring departments through mutual aid agreements.</p>
    <ul class="calls">
      <li>Structural, vehicle, and wildland fires</li>
      <li>Rescues and vehicle accidents</li>
      <li>Medical emergencies</li>
      <li>Other hazards</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="join">
  <figure class="join-photo">
    <img src="/img/photos/lz-training-group.jpg" alt="Volunteers standing in front of a LifeForce medical helicopter in a field" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 60vw, 100vw">
  </figure>
  <div class="join-text">
    <h2>Want to volunteer to help your community?</h2>
    <p>About 20 volunteers serve as firefighters, emergency medical technicians, medical first responders, and support staff, all trained or in training. We are always accepting applications for firefighters and support members.</p>
    <p><a class="button" href="/contact/?topic=join">Apply to volunteer</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="recent">
  <div class="recent-head">
    <h2>Training and calls</h2>
    <a class="text-link" href="/photo-gallery/">See all photos</a>
  </div>
  <ul class="mosaic">
  {%- for p in gallery %}{% if p.home %}
    <li><a href="/photo-gallery/#{{ p.file | replace('.jpg', '') }}"><img src="/img/photos/{{ p.file }}" alt="{{ p.alt }}" sizes="(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw"></a></li>
  {%- endif %}{% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>
